197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 60 0 R
/T (Ans-> Salt-and-pepper noise appears as extreme outlier pixel values \(pure black/white\). Since the median is not influenced by outliers the way a mean is, sorting the neighborhood and picking the middle value effectively discards these extreme values while preserving edges and detail better than averaging filters.)
/E (Ans-> Salt-and-pepper noise appears as extreme outlier pixel values \(pure black/white\). Since the median is not influenced by outliers the way a mean is, sorting the neighborhood and picking the middle value effectively discards these extreme values while preserving edges and detail better than averaging filters.)
